  "titulo": "Irregular affirmative tú commands",
  "subtitulo": "¡Ven acá! ¡Haz la tarea! ¡Ten cuidado!",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Eight common verbs have a short, irregular affirmative tú command: di (decir), haz (hacer), ve (ir), pon (poner), sal (salir), sé (ser), ten (tener), ven (venir).",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Most affirmative **tú** commands look like the **él/ella** present: **habla**, **come**, **escribe**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Eight everyday verbs break the pattern. Their command is a **short, one-syllable** form:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Infinitive",
            "Tú command",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "decir",
              "**di**",
              "Di la verdad."
            ],
            [
              "hacer",
              "**haz**",
              "Haz la tarea."
            ],
            [
              "ir",
              "**ve**",
              "Ve a la tienda."
            ],
            [
              "poner",
              "**pon**",
              "Pon la mesa."
            ],
            [
              "salir",
              "**sal**",
              "Sal de ahí."
            ],
            [
              "ser",
              "**sé**",
              "Sé paciente."
            ],
            [
              "tener",
              "**ten**",
              "Ten cuidado."
            ],
            [
              "venir",
              "**ven**",
              "Ven acá."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Sé** (_be_) has an accent, to tell it apart from the pronoun **se**. **Ve** is also the command of **ver** (_ve la película_ = _watch the movie_); context tells you which."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on these keep the pattern, with an accent: **mantener → mantén**, **obtener → obtén**, **proponer → propón**, **deshacer → deshaz**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: _Vin Diesel has ten weapons_: **ven, di, sal, haz, ten, ve, pon, sé**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Ven== a mi casa el sábado.",
              "en": "Come to my place on Saturday."
            },
            {
