              "en": "Tell the truth."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Ve== a la tienda por tortillas.",
              "en": "Go to the store for tortillas."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Pon== la tabla en el carro, por favor.",
              "en": "Put the board in the car, please."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Sal== temprano para no hacer fila en la garita.",
              "en": "Leave early so you don't have to wait in line at the border."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Sé== paciente con tu hermano.",
              "en": "Be patient with your brother."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Ten== cuidado con las olas hoy.",
              "en": "Be careful with the waves today."
            }
